# Self-contained, like the .gitignore beside it: a copy of this template lives outside the
# Labs repository, where the root .gitattributes does not apply.
#
# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere, so a workspace checkpointed on Windows and one
# checkpointed on Linux produce byte-identical commits. Without this, restoring a
# checkpoint rewrites every file's line endings and the diff between two versions is the
# whole tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
